try quote; illustrative returns cannot determine R.\"","\"Current creditor priority, asset recoverability and debt maturities are unresolved.\"","\"Some linked stress paths fail before entry, without any optional rescue being allowed to cure them.\"","\"Confirmed conversion cash provides a real financing inflow, but its remaining availability is unknown.\"","\"Loss severity and actual funding resilience cannot be scored from conditional scenarios alone.\"","\"Reverse expectations depend on uncertain collection days and margins.\"","\"Property payments, subsidiary minority claims and optional financing materially change the per-share result.\"","\"A lower price could improve conditional returns, but would not repair financial reliability.\"","\"No supported price-implied-expectations score before the operating and funding base is established.\"","\"The19October official interoperability record shows a3000-share lot.\"","\"The₹52 quote is a secondary14October last trade; complete20/60-session BSE turnover and restrictions are unavailable.\"","\"Some trading prints demonstrate activity, not reliable exit capacity over the required window.\"","\"Liquidity and the ₹5 lakh reference exit test remain unscoreable; missing sessions are not zero trades.\"","\"findings\"","\"scope\"","\"open_items\"","\"source\"","\"finding\"","\"FY26 annual report printed55-63\"","\"Unmodified main opinion; KAM nil; no emphasis. Main audit57 explicitly says audit-trail software not used/operational throughout year; Board report46 asserts operated throughout. Main report57 disclaims IFC report under GSR583(E), while AnnexureB62-63 gives positive IFC opinion. These are inconsistencies, not proof of fraud.\"","\"FY26 annual report printed59-61\"","\"CARO says no >5crore working-capital limits; no loans granted then gives no-stipulated-repayment loan language; no term loans; no IPO; no preferential/private placement; no internal audit. Issuance statements contradict IPO and Jan26 warrants/March conversions elsewhere. Bank borrowings alone do not prove a sanctioned working-capital limit.\"","\"FY26 annual report printed64\"","\"Share capital1816.82 + other equity3383.86 + warrant money1073.04 =6273.72 lakh. Printed Total Equity4456.90 omits share capital1816.82. Total assets8854.01 less liabilities2580.29 equals6273.72. No silent correction to source.\"","\"FY26 annual report printed64,66,81,82; FY25 printed45,47\"","\"FY26 receivable cashflow -3763.12 plus short-term advances -1132.53 = -4895.65 lakh, exactly BS receivables increase4903.07 minus loans decline7.42. Labels are suspect but aggregate reconciles. FY25 original receivables1502.54 vs FY26 prior1586.35 difference83.81; original short-term advances96.72 less83.81 gives12.91, approximately regrouped loans12.90. FY25 original debt current927.24/noncurrent252.04 versus FY26 comparative951.77/227.51 shifts24.53 without changing debt1179.28.\"","\"FY25 annual report printed47\"","\"Reported CFO68.06 lakh for FY25 and658.08 for FY24. FY25 tax42.93 and FY24 tax66.21 appear in financing Other outflows; FY24 operating line includes3.86 tax refund. CFO after moving those tax cash payments to operating is25.13 and591.87 respectively; these are analytical classifications, not reported figures. FY25 capex6.36; FY24 cash PPE168.80 plus320.00 other investing outflow.\"","\"FY26 annual report printed66,83\"","\"CFO includes unexplained Other inflows1165.00 lakh; financing share cash880.00 and warrant money1073.04 while securities-premium additions1346.02 and OCI-23.14 require a full issuance/expense reconciliation. Reported CFO-2524.19, capex6.26, borrowing cash716.86, finance cash139.77. Do not automatically label the entire1165 share premium without reconciliation.\"","\"FY26 annual report printed82,84 versus secretarial46-47\"","\"Note15 authorized capital15000000 shares conflicts with resolutions16000000 in March25 and36000000 in December25. Note17 footnotes about 2024 tranches13808687 and15000000 warrants conflict with19110000 January26 warrants and16508000 outstanding at March26. These footnotes cannot reliably define current dilution.\"","\"FY26 annual report printed85,91-96\"","\"Security note describes Yogi Sea real-estate loans and Manan Trading property, requiring verification for jewellery issuer. RPT table FY26 nil remuneration/loans conflicts with loans-to-related5.48 in Note6 and other remuneration disclosures. Credit-risk text33887.14/13095.44 lakh conflicts with BS receivables6489.42/1586.35. Top five customers disclosed100% of revenue; all receivables under6months invoice-age, no ECL. Maturity table blank despite debt1896.13.\"","\"FY25 annual report printed36-44\"","\"Unmodified main opinion, nil KAM, no emphasis. Main report38 disclaims IFC report while separate43-44 gives positive IFC opinion, so this contradiction predates FY26. No audit-trail statement found in the full FY25 main opinion. CARO template has no-loans versus no-repayment-schedule contradiction. No auditor resignation and no reported fraud are qualified facts, not affirmative fraud-free assurance.\"","\"FY25 annual report printed45-47\"","\"FY24 comparatives revenue2327.83/PAT340.96; FY25 revenue2349.21/PAT243.28. FY25 other expense234.12 includes company-services190.77; FY24 other expense33.71. FY26 comparative revenue2349.20 differs0.01 rounding. FY25 original accounts AS3, FY26 describes IndAS7 and IndAS108, but formal adoption/reconciliation is not yet established.\"","\"FY22 original audit-only PDF2-10, signed23September2022\"","\"Unmodified opinion, nil KAM, no emphasis; main audit says IFC exempt. CARO no-loans/no-repayment-schedule boilerplate contradiction present. CARO9 explicitly records noncash director Savinay Lodha transaction4.90 lakh and states Section192 compliance; cash loss0.639741 lakh. These facts are not misconduct allegations.\"","\"FY23 original audit-only PDF2-10, signed30September2023\"","\"Unmodified opinion, nil KAM, no emphasis; main audit says IFC exempt. CARO9 explicitly records noncash director Savinay Lodha transaction71.597 lakh and states Section192 compliance; cash profit360.4507123 lakh. CARO says no preferential/private placement, requiring reconciliation against FY23 consideration shares in takeover history, not automatic accusation.\"","\"Prospectus printed29–34\"","\"Four company tax matters total85.68 lakh; twelve promoter/director matters359.17 lakh. Do not aggregate the latter as company obligations. Office-transfer registration and factory-license formalities remained pending at IPO; no later clearance established.\"","\"Postal notice PDF4 and explanatory statement; FY26 annual report50 and Note36\"","\"April2026 proposed MD salary60 lakh per year, previously24 lakh, perquisites capped at equal salary. Proposed authorization is not confirmed cash paid. FY26 remuneration ratio8:1 contradicts nil managerial-pay aggregate disclosure.\"","\"Originalsourcefacts checked; all negativeinferences conditional; no fraud allegation\"","\"Complete IPO, premium, warrant and cash reconciliation, including1165 lakh other operating inflow and−23.14 lakh retained-earnings adjustment.\"","\"Corrected equity total and accounting-basis transition; audit-trail, IFC and CARO reconciliation.\"","\"Current bank cash, receivable confirmations, creditor/tax settlements and debt maturity schedule.\"","\"Executed property payment terms, cash already paid, actual charges and funding.\"","\"Subsidiary ownership/transition, minority claims, related-party cash and remuneration.\"","\"Current pledged collateral, sanctioned facilities and committed unused headroom.\"","\"Official full60-session BSE trading values, spread, restrictions, free float and lot confirmation.\"","\"exchange\"","\"scrip\"","\"listing_date\"","\"incorporation\"","\"CIN\"","\"shares_2026_03_31\"","\"shares_2026_06_30\"","\"shares_2026_08_13_and_19Oct\"","\"shares_2026_10_20_after_allotment\"","\"warrants_initial\"","\"warrants_converted_to_31Mar\"","\"warrants_remainin